# Card link / button alignment

In any card grid (P-05, ServiceCard, Features2, handmade cards), if a card has a **link or button**, pin it to the **bottom** of the card. Uneven body copy must not move the CTA.

Required classes:

- Card: `flex flex-col h-full`
- Body / description: `flex-1` (fills leftover height)
- Link or button: `mt-auto` (and `pt-4` if it needs space above)

Never leave the CTA sitting directly under short copy while neighboring cards have longer paragraphs. Cards in the same row must share one height; their links line up.
